---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer, trunc(_score, 3) as _score FROM vector_search(qs, 'secondary', question) where subject!='math' order by _score desc LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: _score DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |   Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), question).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), question).answer, trunc(vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), question)._score, Int64(3)) AS _score                                                   |
|               |     TableScan: vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), question) projection=[id, answer, _score], full_filters=[vector_search(qs, Utf8("secondary"), question).subject != Utf8("math")]                                                                       |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [_score@2 DESC], fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@2 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer, trunc(_score@2, 3) as _score]                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |       SortExec: TopK(fetch=1000), expr=[_score@2 DESC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |         ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer, 1 - cosine_distance(CAST(query_vector() AS List(Field { data_type: Float32, nullable: true })), CAST(question_embedding@3 AS List(Field { data_type: Float32, nullable: true }))) as _score] |
|               |           RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             FilterExec: subject@2 != math                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |               SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                   DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[2]                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
